    "paragraph": "The first paper developed a multi-level safety-augmented calibration framework for car-following models to integrate kinematic alignment with regime and risk-level constraints. A second study presented a reproducible multi-sensor workflow integrating photogrammetry, SLAM-based mapping, and geodetic control to document complex cultural heritage monuments. Finally, researchers used clustering algorithms on multi-source geographical big data to delineate and classify 67 commercial districts within Beijing's 5th Ring Road.",
